  "body": "Welcome to 4 Lanark Road – an exciting new development offering 7 brand new standalone homes in one of Auckland's most sought-after North Shore locations.\r\n\r\nChoose from:\r\n• 6 x Four-Bedroom Homes\r\n• 1 x Three-Bedroom Home\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, these stylish house and land packages combine comfort, convenience, and low-maintenance living in the highly desirable Westlake school zone.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights:\r\n• Brand new standalone houses\r\n• 3 or 4 bedrooms available\r\n• 3.5 bathrooms (selected 4-bedroom homes)\r\n• Single internal access garage\r\n• Modern kitchens and light-filled living areas\r\n• Quality finishes throughout\r\n• Easy-care sections\r\n• Zoned for Westlake Boys & Westlake Girls High Schools\r\n• Approx. 1 minute drive to State Highway 1\r\n• Approx. 5 minutes drive to Milford Beach and shopping centre\r\n\r\nEach home has been thoughtfully designed to maximise space and functionality, featuring open-plan living, generous bedrooms, and contemporary finishes throughout. Whether you're upsizing, investing, or securing your family's future in a premium school zone, these homes offer an outstanding opportunity.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of nearby schools, shopping, beaches, and transport links while benefiting from the peace of mind that comes with a brand new home.\r\n\r\nLimited availability – only 7 homes in total. Contact us today for plans, pricing, and further information.",
